id: telekinetic
name: Telekinetic
kind: crafting
slots: 1
prerequisites: The wielder has the Telekinesis Unique Ability.
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Held by the mind: not one of the two Weapons wielded, and attacks with it come from anywhere
  in a Large Sphere around you. Needs Telekinesis.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Wielding this Weapon does not count towards your maximum number of Weapons you’re
  able to wield. Also, when making an Attacking Maneuver with this Weapon, it can originate from
  any square within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) as if you were on that square.
text: >
  Telekinetic: You can control this Weapon with your mind.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: The wielder has the Telekinesis Unique Ability.
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Wielding this Weapon does not count towards your maximum number of Weapons you’re
  able to wield. Also, when making an Attacking Maneuver with this Weapon, it can originate from
  any square within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) as if you were on that square.

---

# Only in the mind of one with the Telekinesis Unique Ability - a Maneuver of theirs by that
# name, asked where it is read (heldByMind() in module/gear.mjs). Which Square in the Sphere the
# attack comes from is the table's: its Melee Range and its Long Range are not measured.
[passive]
weapon.telekinetic = true;

# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Telekinesis Unique Ability is not in this system. Until it is, nobody has it, and this does
# nothing - a Maneuver the player names Telekinesis is what it looks for.
